From 06b3d4f4a1beaa2da43e9303bdc318008065f6e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "MOTOR-47 (Claude)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:45:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Shared pinned tabs: defer synchronizing a window with a
 pending unpin

From Brave master (after 1.98). Unpinning a shared pinned tab posts
OnTabUnpinned(), which updates |pinned_tab_data_| later. If the window
is synchronized in between (SynchronizeNewBrowser(), e.g. when it is
activated), it has one pinned tab fewer than |pinned_tab_data_|, is
taken as out of sync and gets a stray dummy pinned tab. Track the models
with a pending unpin (cleared in OnTabUnpinned() and when a model is
destroyed) and defer their synchronization to a task posted after it.
Browser test SynchronizeRightAfterUnpinAddsNoStrayPinnedTab.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MwmK2hjxRPyuefYzGRoZRk
